          <p>
            <strong>Important:</strong> Pinto Injury Resources is an informational website operated by a law student. It is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice, medical advice, legal representation, or individualized guidance.
          </p>
        </section>

      </article>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>